---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="Insights & Thought Leadership | Causewave" 
  description="Expert insights on CSR consulting, healthcare innovation, and technology-enabled social impact."
  ogTitle="Insights | Causewave Innovations LLP"
  ogDescription="Thought leadership on CSR strategy and healthcare delivery innovation."
  canonicalPath="insights/"
  activePage="insights"
>
  <main>
    <!-- Hero -->
    <section class="bg-slate-900 text-white section">
      <div class="max-w-screen-2xl mx-auto px-6">
        <div class="max-w-3xl">
          <span class="text-sky-400 font-semibold text-sm tracking-widest">INSIGHTS</span>
          <h1 class="hero-animate mt-3 text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl font-semibold tracking-tighter leading-tight">
            Insights & Thought Leadership
          </h1>
          <p class="hero-animate hero-animate-delay-1 mt-5 text-lg text-slate-300 max-w-2xl">
            Expert perspectives on CSR innovation and healthcare delivery.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Featured: Founder Story -->
    <section class="max-w-screen-2xl mx-auto px-6 py-8">
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 items-center bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-50 to-white border rounded-2xl p-6 md:p-8">
        <div>
          <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold mb-4">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-trophy"></i> SKOCH Gold Award &middot; IIM Raipur Case Study
          </div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight mb-3">Dr. Hemant L. Patel — 18+ Years of Public Health Impact</h2>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-3">
            From designing Gujarat's award-winning Chitta/Cheetah Bike Express last-mile model to enabling Bihar's record-breaking 33 lakh+ single-day COVID-19 vaccinations — the highest in India — Dr. Patel brings field-tested public health leadership to every CSR engagement.
          </p>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            His work spans WHO surveillance strengthening, CARE India multi-state expansion across 11 states, government health systems in Gujarat and Bihar, and health-tech entrepreneurship. Recognized internationally as a speaker at Biologistics World Asia 2021.
          </p>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 text-xs text-slate-500 mb-5">
            <span><i class="fa-solid fa-building-columns mr-1"></i> WHO &middot; CARE India &middot; Govt of Gujarat</span>
            <span><i class="fa-solid fa-stethoscope mr-1"></i> Public Health & CSR</span>
          </div>
          <a href={`${base}insights/founder-story/`} class="inline-flex px-5 py-2.5 bg-slate-900 text-white rounded-full text-sm font-semibold hover:bg-sky-600 transition-all">
            Read Full Story <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right ml-2"></i>
          </a>
        </div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3">
          <div class="bg-white border p-4 rounded-xl text-center shadow-sm">
            <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-sky-600 mb-1">33 Lakh+</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-slate-600">Single-Day Vaccinations</div>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-white border p-4 rounded-xl text-center shadow-sm">
            <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-teal-600 mb-1">30+</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-slate-600">Outbreaks Detected (WHO)</div>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-white border p-4 rounded-xl text-center shadow-sm">
            <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-emerald-600 mb-1">11</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-slate-600">States (CARE India)</div>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-white border p-4 rounded-xl text-center shadow-sm">
            <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-sky-600 mb-1">18+</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-slate-600">Years in Public Health</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Published Articles -->
    <section class="bg-white">
      <div class="max-w-screen-2xl mx-auto px-6 py-8">
        <div class="text-center mb-6">
          <span class="text-sky-600 font-semibold text-sm">LATEST</span>
          <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight mt-1">Published Articles</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
          <article class="bg-white border rounded-xl overflow-hidden hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all">
            <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-500 to-emerald-700 p-4 text-white">
              <span class="inline-block bg-white/20 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full text-xs mb-2">CSR Strategy</span>
              <h3 class="text-base font-semibold">Breaking the Top 100 Spell: Unlocking Mid-Cap CSR for NGO Survival</h3>
            </div>
            <div class="p-4">
              <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm mb-3">In the shadow of FCRA clamps and USAID's exit, India's NGOs have one lifeline left: CSR. But chasing the same 10 giants? That's a recipe for collapse.</p>
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-slate-500 mb-3">
                <span>Dr. Hemant L. Patel</span>
                <span>•</span>
                <span>Sep 29, 2025</span>
              </div>
              <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/pulse/breaking-top-100-spell-unlocking-mid-cap-csr-ngo-survival-patel-khrmf/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center text-sky-600 text-sm font-semibold hover:text-sky-700">
                Read More <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right ml-1"></i>
              </a>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="bg-white border rounded-xl overflow-hidden hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all">
            <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-sky-500 to-sky-700 p-4 text-white">
              <span class="inline-block bg-white/20 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full text-xs mb-2">CSR Strategy</span>
              <h3 class="text-base font-semibold">Beyond Networks: Redefining CSR Resource Mapping for India's NGOs</h3>
            </div>
            <div class="p-4">
              <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm mb-3">In the span of a single funding cycle, India's social sector has shifted its center of gravity. The familiar flows—once sustained by FCRA clearances and global donors like USAID—have faded.</p>
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-slate-500 mb-3">
                <span>Dr. Hemant L. Patel</span>
                <span>•</span>
                <span>Sep 20, 2025</span>
              </div>
              <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/pulse/beyond-networks-redefining-csr-resource-mapping-indias-patel-tipbf/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center text-sky-600 text-sm font-semibold hover:text-sky-700">
                Read More <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right ml-1"></i>
              </a>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="bg-white border rounded-xl overflow-hidden hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all">
            <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-violet-500 to-violet-700 p-4 text-white">
              <span class="inline-block bg-white/20 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full text-xs mb-2">AI & Technology</span>
              <h3 class="text-base font-semibold">The Art of Sahdev: Ancient Wisdom for Modern AI Mastery</h3>
            </div>
            <div class="p-4">
              <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm mb-3">In the epic Mahabharata, five Pandava brothers share a throne and destiny. While Arjuna dazzles with archery and Bhima dominates with raw strength, the youngest, Sahdev, operates in the shadows.</p>
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-slate-500 mb-3">
                <span>Dr. Hemant L. Patel</span>
                <span>•</span>
                <span>Sep 15, 2025</span>
              </div>
              <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/pulse/art-sahdev-ancient-wisdom-modern-ai-mastery-dr-hemant-patel-qoauf/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center text-sky-600 text-sm font-semibold hover:text-sky-700">
                Read More <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right ml-1"></i>
              </a>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="bg-white border rounded-xl overflow-hidden hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all">
            <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-500 to-amber-700 p-4 text-white">
              <span class="inline-block bg-white/20 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full text-xs mb-2">Development Sector</span>
              <h3 class="text-base font-semibold">A Problem Unacknowledged is a Solution Out of Reach</h3>
            </div>
            <div class="p-4">
              <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm mb-3">India's development sector is bleeding funds, yet denial keeps solutions out of reach. Post-pandemic, even established NGOs face dwindling resources.</p>
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-slate-500 mb-3">
                <span>Dr. Hemant L. Patel</span>
                <span>•</span>
                <span>May 13, 2025</span>
              </div>
              <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/pulse/problem-unacknowledged-solution-out-reach-dr-hemant-patel-iqbff/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center text-sky-600 text-sm font-semibold hover:text-sky-700">
                Read More <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right ml-1"></i>
              </a>
            </div>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
